// admin.proto — PolicyAdminService: policy lifecycle management.
//
// A Policy attaches rate-limit rules at Project, Workspace, or Key scope.
// Policy types:
//   floor    — hard guardrails set by org admins; cannot be narrowed by lower scopes
//   flexible — constraints that workspace/key owners may further restrict
//
// Evaluation order: Project → Workspace → Key
// Project-level policies establish organizational guardrails.
// Workspace and Key policies may only narrow, never widen Project constraints.
//
// PolicyRule mirrors the RateLimitRule from the config system design:
// zero values mean "unconstrained" for that dimension. Multiple limits on the
// same rule are independent — whichever is exhausted first triggers on_exceed.
// All matching rules across all scopes accumulate and are enforced simultaneously.
//
// policy_id is server-assigned as a UUID7.
//
// Authentication: every RPC requires AUTH_TYPE_API_KEY with scope "admin".
//
// Field numbers are stable and must not be reused once released.

